  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9006.01 Laboratory Accreditation, Independent Analysis",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9006.01 Laboratory Accreditation, Independent Analysis. Any laboratory that performs an analysis of an additional test to determine its alcohol concentration pursuant to RSA 265-A:7, shall be accredited by a nationally recognized accrediting body pursuant to RSA 265-A:5, V.\n\nSource. #12556, eff 6-21-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9000.html"
